  "hero_image": {
    "url": "/images/courses/emporda-dunes/hero.jpg"
  },
  "description_short": "Empordà Dunes is a bold and wind-swept challenge. Where others saw unremarkable marshland, architect Robert von Hagge saw an opportunity to craft a course of pure imagination. Empordà Dunes is a masterful blend of rolling inland dunes, unpredictable coastal winds, and modern water hazards, capturing the soul of traditional Scottish links while adding its own unique character.",
  "description_long": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Empordà Dunes is a bold and wind-swept challenge. Where others saw unremarkable marshland, architect Robert von Hagge saw an opportunity to craft a course of pure imagination. Empordà Dunes is a masterful blend of rolling inland dunes, unpredictable coastal winds, and modern water hazards, capturing the soul of traditional Scottish links while adding its own unique character."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "/images/courses/emporda-dunes/hero2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Stretching 6300 meters, this dynamic course rewards players who combine precision, strategy, and creativity. The ever-changing wind conditions make club selection a constant challenge, while the open layout demands a keen eye for positioning. With its thrilling mix of natural beauty and strategic design, Empordà Dunes delivers an exhilarating test for golfers of all levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "/images/courses/emporda-dunes/hero3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Empordà Golf's two world-class courses, designed by Robert von Hagge and Rick Baril, offer a unique experience in every round. This European Tour hosting resort combines the joy of playing golf with the pleasure of walking surrounded by nature."
    }
  ],
